      "annotation_id": "dafa4412dca94856a2eebcabb474eee2_171",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In para 21, it is stated Muniraju M vs Reeni on 4 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/40571489/\n8 that the plaintiff and his wife are in permissive possession of the suit schedule premises from 1996."
