      "annotation_id": "0d69d9c2a92340e4b39ef0dc2b7f958c_191",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the plaintiff and his wife are not staying in the suit schedule premises for long time, on the other hand,\nin all probabilities after plaintiff's wife transferred to defendant school appeared to have staying in the suit schedule "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "58d95b7aae5347d08c9dbe388169f195_192",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the possession of plaintiff and his wife in the suit schedule premises is not lawful and it is unauthorize and illegal."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4b626b43d00c4a338756ecda644ea29b_193",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "18. The counsel for the plaintiff in the cross- examination of DW.1 has suggested that the plaintiff and his wife are staying in the suit schedule premises from 1996 on permissive possession."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2287d2554f8648c99e1baa3f76c942aa_194",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If said OS.No. 2431/2024 suggestion is taken into consideration, assuming that the School or Education department has permitted the plaintiff and his wife to stay in the suit schedule premises, it is only on permission as that of a licensee"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ddd52078419b4c429e90fa77e9f436f8_195",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Once permission is revoked by issuing notice, the plaintiff and his wife have no business to stay in the suit schedule premises."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f29eb3da07d24c1ca98195ca1ddd6048_196",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n19. PW.1 admitted there are 600 children are studying in the school."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8488cf95ca0b4e17872aef946d344aa1_197",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Due to shortage of school rooms under \"Viveka Shala Yojane\" 8 rooms are sanctioned for construction."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c23860133f8043c5820c91bbd2088ac2_198",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The work order and Muniraju M vs Reeni on 4 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/40571489/\n9 estimation order are also placed before the Court, which would show Rs.83.40 lakhs was sanctioned for construction of 8 rooms"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "57858e8a2d974cf58bbed3e988018176_199",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The existing 3 dilapidated rooms are demolished for the purpose of construction of 8 rooms."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "59b9d00b4f8e40adbb2d6db3651e6c9f_200",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The photographs would depicts presently the children are sitting outside the school building and classes are being conducted due to shortage of school rooms."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e8ee46878e1545dabe088136c5499036_201",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nOS.No. 2431/2024 19(a)."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eb147ba559d94c29ad5781cb3126ece1_202",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The suit schedule premises is situated in the place where the proposed 8 class rooms are to be constructed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1404f8f87ffa4f68a0e402035a894798_203",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the existence of shed for the purpose of construction of 8 rooms is an obstruction."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7d502e1302ed48a1b36bc020bcd39d69_204",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the work order the construction of rooms have to be completed before 28-08-2024."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "09373dee839c4161bf898a25666a7c9b_205",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But, it has not been carried out due to obstruction by the plaintiff and his wife by not vacating the premises."
    },
