      "annotation_id": "2d5679ebd24f4ef0a8da8e79eb0cffb1_206",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, if the construction is not completed within the financial year, there is every chance of lapse of the amount which was granted for construction of class rooms for welfare of the children in the interest of their academic activiti"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5b82c2fb1340440ca73bdbe24b508154_207",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The issuance of notice by the defendants to the plaintiff's wife to vacate the shed in the school premises cannot be termed as interference."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e8b257d0436347bb912a70d08eee5201_208",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The plaintiff himself is not in lawful possession of suit schedule premises."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a0f7639c91a740988db2174f3717cf0a_209",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The wife of plaintiff being employee of 'D' group working in the same school, not vacating the premises so as to OS.No. 2431/2024 accommodate construction of 8 rooms for academic activities of the children amounts to misconduct."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a6184b4cd18b4c0ca44e00a711382347_210",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "20. The plaintiff has not placed any material to hold that he is in lawful possession of suit schedule property."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0399d879dfe84dd5ae12661b24a23025_211",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "There is no material since from the time of his father he has been in occupation of suit schedule premises."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5f31303e2c2741b68e82ef2e44eb9703_212",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The plaintiff has suppressed the material facts."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "400dd13dae674036ac347e889ff800d3_213",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The suit for permanent injunction, it is a discretionary relief."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8ef010da1f364343864a13bce9370924_214",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The person who approaches the Court must come with clean hands without any suppression."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3627fe1841c246988eb6e27f2b9e0c01_215",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The plaintiff has not able to establish that he is in lawful possession of suit schedule premises."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e5dd43d5bcbd4c058396116a76a58551_216",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "His possession is unlawful and unauthorized."
    },
    {
